If an operation changes nothing: (a) check the operation's preconditions in the precondition table; (b) check whether another constraint still binds the same step; (c) test it combined with each operation that affects the same step.
Precondition table: {"engine_rules":{"start":"A step starts when it is required, the source of every start edge into it is done or not required, and, if it has triggers, one trigger has fired (its when predicate holds and its condition is true).","complete":"A prepared step completes when the source of every complete edge into it and of every derived data gate is done or not required, and its bound records are current.","trigger":"A trigger fires once and stays fired; an after predicate holds when its step is done or not required; an on predicate holds once a matching event has been emitted."},"operations":[{"op":"remove_soft_edge","changes":"the start edges or complete edges of the edge's target","has_effect_only_if":"the target's start rule (or completion rule, for a complete edge) is no longer equivalent once the edge is gone: no other start edge, and not every trigger, of the target still waits on the same source or on a step that is done only after it","rule":"start"},{"op":"add_soft_edge","changes":"the start edges or complete edges of the target","has_effect_only_if":"the new source is not already implied by the target's rule and is done after the target would otherwise start or complete","rule":"start"},{"op":"move_step_after","changes":"replaces every incoming soft edge of the moved step with one edge from the named step","has_effect_only_if":"the moved step's start rule changes after the replacement; its triggers are untouched, so a trigger that still waits on the old source keeps the old start","rule":"start"},{"op":"set_prep_trigger","changes":"replaces every trigger of the target with one trigger on the new predicate, keeping the first trigger's condition","has_effect_only_if":"the target's start rule changes: no start edge into the target still waits on the old trigger's step or on a later one, and the new predicate holds at a different minute","rule":"trigger"},{"op":"add_condition","changes":"the target step's required_when, every trigger condition on the target, or the scope condition","has_effect_only_if":"the condition is false for some case at the minute the engine reads it; a condition true for every case changes nothing","rule":"start"},{"op":"rebind_section","changes":"one section binding of a document, and so the derived data gates of the steps that prepare it","has_effect_only_if":"the new record kind is produced at a different minute than the old one, so the derived completion gate or the stale-record revision moves","rule":"complete"}],"method":"Each row lists the rule an operation edits and when that edit can reach the engine; run_experiment applies the same test to a request before it runs and refuses one that leaves every rule equivalent."}

